// Many failed logons against a SINGLE account (possible brute force).
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1110 Brute Force (Credential Access)
// Event 4625 = failed logon. Many failures for one account is brute force, as
// opposed to a spray (many accounts, few failures each). Counts by target
// account and fires past a threshold.
SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4625
| summarize Failures = count(), Sources = make_set(Computer, 10),
    StartTime = min(TimeGenerated), EndTime = max(TimeGenerated) by TargetAccount
| where Failures >= 10
